<p>A strange restroom that never had been connected to the public infrastructure. It has something strange, making people go there more often. Other than that rather harmless.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>Brief: A restroom that has a connection to someplace other that the infrastructure surrounding it. It is somewhat behaving like an entity or part of one. Due to reactions with people it acts like some digestive tract.</p>
<p>Greenlight (2): <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13809212/seeking-greenlight:disconnected-restroom">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13809212/seeking-greenlight:disconnected-restroom</a><br />
Draft: <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/galcedion">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/galcedion</a><br />
Word count: 1064 (current revision)</p>
<p>My first SCP-draft but I hope it meets the guidelines. So no specifics to check. For those who read - thanks in advance!</p>

